594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":3,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":3.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920375103803789312","date":1508269499000,"rawContent":"Indeed. The whole point of #MeToo is that this pervasive predatory behavior does not get talked about publicly.. https:\/\/t.co\/hNM2UVCCot","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":4,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":4.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920376151440347136","date":1508269748000,"rawContent":".. which is the entire fucking point of #MeToo. Far too often these pervasive toxic dynamics are publicly ignored as a matter of routine.","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":5,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":5.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920377227358896132","date":1508270005000,"rawContent":"The reason many men deny that sexual harassment and assault are harassment and assault is the simple fact of their own complicity. #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":6.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920378026440970240","date":1508270195000,"rawContent":"A very good indicator of a sexual predator is one who can read multiple #MeToo stories and conclude \"Nah, that's not harassment.\"","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":7,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920379434355560449","date":1508270531000,"rawContent":"This. And remember you can share privately, with a trusted confidante or therapist. There is no obligation to *ever* share publicly. #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/2sMhxC1Dcw","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":8,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":8.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920382634387222529","date":1508271294000,"rawContent":"One thing I will say about sexual harassment \/ assault in academia - and I wish I knew this as a student: Know your campus policies. #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":9,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rolling