, men lose their jobs..","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":31.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":23,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":23.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920421738168627201","date":1508280617000,"rawContent":"So again, as y'all react to #MeToo: Do you really care about sexual violence or do you only care about \"respectable\" intersections?","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":32.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":24,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":24.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920423404582432768","date":1508281014000,"rawContent":"The sad reality is that even as more and more people speak out and say #MeToo, some of us will be believed, others systematically dismissed.","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":33.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":25,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":25.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920424055781675008","date":1508281170000,"rawContent":"Few cared then, few care now. So there are very real and serious limits to the discursive power of campaigns like #MeToo.","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":34.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":26,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":26.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920427654691672066","date":1508282028000,"rawContent":"But a lot of sexual harassment and assault occurs between \"peers\" regardless of your professional or educational context. #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":35.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":27,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":27.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920466004999856128","date":1508291171000,"rawContent":"Because these assholes demanding that women identify our harassers have me wondering: How often do men, on their own, \"name names\"? #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":36.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":28,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":28.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920466250941247490","date":1508291230000,"rawContent":"How often do men begin a meeting with \"Before we get started, I just have to call out Harold for sexually harassing Lisa yesterday..\" #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":37.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":29,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":29.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920466846616358916","date":1508291372000,"rawContent":"I have never in my entire life witnessed a man publicly out another man for sexual harassing or assaulting anyone. At any time. Ever. #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":38.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":30,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":30.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920636251845332993","date":1508331761000,"rawContent":"Reminder: You don't have the right to tell other women what our \"only\" options are. You have the right to do what's best for you. #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/9mw3toJYsa","userId":885594949,"media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/DMbBn23WkAAmo8B?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":39.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":31,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":31.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920651259560022016","date":1508335339000,"rawContent":"Once again: Before you harass women demanding that we \"name names\", make a list of the sexual predators you've identified in public. #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":40.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":32,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":32.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920652468672966656","date":1508335628000,"rawContent":"You don't get to pop up in someone's #MeToo and, like an ass, tell them what risks they should take with their lives, career or wellbeing.","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":41.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":33,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":33.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"920683647203725312","date":1508343061000,"rawContent":"I continually remind myself that abusive behavior always reflects on the abuser -- not the target. And compassion is still possible. #MeToo","userId":885594949,"media":null,"username":"alwaystheself","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":42.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":245,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":34,"sumOfClimate":7,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":8.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":34.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0}]